    "css": "/* Lucky Rainbow: a night market of a theme. Every colour at once, a\n   backdrop that never stops moving, and a lucky charm in front of anything\n   that will hold still for one. Drawn in gradients and emoji, so the theme\n   carries only its two cursors. Click anywhere: the shell's confetti\n   answers. */\n@keyframes lucky-drift { to { background-position: 400% 50%; } }\n@keyframes lucky-bob { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-4px); } }\n@keyframes lucky-twinkle { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.35; } }\n.bg-backdrop {\n  background-image: linear-gradient(120deg, #ff9ff3, #ffd93d, #6bcb77, #4d96ff, #ff6b6b, #c77dff, #ff9ff3);\n  background-size: 400% 400%;\n  background-attachment: fixed;\n  animation: lucky-drift 14s linear infinite;\n}\n[data-rail], [data-sidebar] {\n  --color-surface: #ff2e88;\n  --color-surface-raised: #ff5ca3;\n  --color-border: #ffd600;\n  --color-border-strong: #fff176;\n  --color-ink: #ffffff;\n  --color-ink-muted: #ffe6f2;\n  --color-ink-subtle: #ffc2e2;\n  --color-accent: #ffd600;\n  --color-accent-subtle: #c2185b;\n  --color-selection: #c2185b;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #ff2e88, #7c3aed 55%, #00b8d4);\n}\n[data-sidebar] a::before { content: \"🧧 \"; }\n[data-sidebar] a:hover::before { content: \"🎉 \"; }\n[data-sidebar] a[aria-current]::before, [data-sidebar] a[data-active]::before { content: \"🌟 \"; }\n[data-shell-header] {\n  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b6b 0 48px, #ffd93d 48px 96px, #6bcb77 96px 144px, #4d96ff 144px 192px, #c77dff 192px 240px);\n  border-bottom: 4px dotted #ffd600;\n}\nh1::after { content: \" 🌈✨\"; }\nh2::before { content: \"🎊 \"; }\nh3::before { content: \"🍀 \"; }\n[data-card]::before, [data-issue-row] td:first-child::before { content: \"🧨 \"; }\n[data-card]:hover::before { content: \"💥 \"; }\n[data-card] {\n  background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8e1, #ffe4f1 50%, #e0f7ff);\n  border: 2px solid #ff4fa3;\n}\nbutton, [role=\"button\"] {\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #ffd600, 0 5px 0 #7c3aed;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.6);\n}\nbutton:hover, [role=\"button\"]:hover { animation: lucky-bob 0.6s ease-in-out infinite; }\nbutton:active, [role=\"button\"]:active { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #ffd600, 0 1px 0 #7c3aed; transform: translateY(4px); }\ninput, select, textarea {\n  border: 3px dashed #ff4fa3;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(#ffffff, #fff0f6);\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { border-style: solid; border-color: #ffd600; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgb(255 214 0 / 0.5), 0 0 24px #ff2e88; }\nth { background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd93d, #ff9ff3, #7afcff); }\ntr:nth-child(odd) td { background-color: rgb(255 214 0 / 0.08); }\ntr:nth-child(even) td { background-color: rgb(0 229 255 / 0.08); }\na:hover { text-decoration: underline wavy #ff2e88; }\n[data-status] { animation: lucky-twinkle 2s ease-in-out infinite; }\n::selection { background: #ffd600; color: #3b0764; }\n[data-empty-state]::before { content: \"🥟🍡🧋 \"; font-size: 2rem; display: block; }\n",
    "effect": "confetti"
  },
